changeling-infect-target = You have become a changeling! You are in regenerative stasis. Once you have regenerated 60 chemicals, use Exit stasis to revive. Your starting evolution points are half the usual amount.

evolutionmenu-organic-sequencer-name = Organic sequencer
evolutionmenu-organic-sequencer-desc = Sabotage electronics with a touch, like an emag. Costs 30 chemicals per hack. Evolution lets you hack visible devices up to 7 meters away for 5 chemicals.
evolutionmenu-adaptive-regeneration-name = Adaptive regeneration
evolutionmenu-adaptive-regeneration-desc = Regenerate 4 damage of each type per second, stop bleeding and rapidly restore lost blood. Costs 5 chemicals per second, even at full health. Evolution doubles healing and lowers upkeep to 3 chemicals per second. It also regrows a missing body part or organ every 10 seconds for 10 extra chemicals, replacing prostheses.
evolutionmenu-pain-suppression-name = Suppress pain
evolutionmenu-pain-suppression-desc = Deaden your pain to prevent injury slowdown, shock damage, stamina damage and stuns. Costs 2 chemicals per second, or nothing after Evolution. Physical injuries still harm you.
evolutionmenu-shock-hand-name = Concealed shock hand
evolutionmenu-shock-hand-desc = Deliver concealed electrical strikes that stun your target. Each hit costs 10 chemicals. Evolution unleashes a stronger shock that instantly knocks your target down, once every 30 seconds.

evolutionmenu-evolving-armblade-desc = Reshape your arm into a blade of flesh and bone. Costs 20 chemicals to grow or retract. Evolution transforms it into a more powerful blade.
evolutionmenu-evolving-shriek-desc = Unleash an electromagnetic shriek that disrupts nearby electronics. Evolution also disorients living creatures and shatters lights. Costs 30 chemicals.
evolutionmenu-enhanced-strength-name = Enhanced Strength
evolutionmenu-evolving-muscles-desc = Double your melee damage, move faster and force open powered or bolted airlocks. Welded doors remain sealed. Costs 3 chemicals per second while active. Evolution raises melee damage to three times normal, increases speed further and reduces all damage taken by 20%.
changeling-strength-enabled = Your muscles surge with unnatural strength.
changeling-strength-disabled = Your muscles relax.
evolutionmenu-evolving-eyes-desc = Protect your eyes from flashes and see in darkness. Evolution also reveals heat signatures through walls. Toggle at will.
evolutionmenu-evolving-chameleon-desc = Cloak your body to blend into your surroundings. Costs 15 chemicals to toggle and 1.25 per second while active. Evolution lets you move without revealing yourself and reduces upkeep to 0.5 chemicals per second.
changeling-regrown = Your { $part } has regenerated.
changeling-absorb-fragment = We consume the fragment and replenish our biomass.

evolutionmenu-evolution-name = Evolution
evolutionmenu-evolution-desc = Permanently evolve your hive's abilities, including future purchases. Strengthen armblades, chemistry, shock hands, regeneration, pain suppression, hacking, camouflage, muscles, eyes and stasis. Halve devour and possession stages. Unlock specialized abilities for fragments and optional living blood. Costs 10 evolution points, once.
